1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,500
When Ravana carried Sita away,

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:12,500
an old guardian heard her cry.

3
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,700
Jatayu stood in his path.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,500
Age had weakened his body, but not his resolve.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,500
He broke the king’s bow.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,300
He shattered the chariot.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,500
But the struggle exhausted him.

8
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:58,500
Ravana struck, and Jatayu fell.

9
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,800
Ravana escaped with Sita.

10
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:13,100
Jatayu held on long enough to bear witness.

11
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:20,700
He named Sita’s captor.

12
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,700
Rama bowed beside him.

13
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,300
His wings fell. His courage did not.
